---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'About Bryan Alan Manly | Suncoast Home Check — Tampa Bay Home Watch';
const description =
  'Suncoast Home Check is founded by Bryan Alan Manly, a longtime Tampa Bay real estate advisor. Trusted, local home watch for second homes, townhomes, and condos across the Gulf Coast.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonical="/about/">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <img src="/assets/hero.jpg" alt="Tampa Bay Gulf coast at golden hour" />
    <div class="scrim"></div>
    <div class="inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>A local name you already know.</h1>
      <div class="gold-line"></div>
      <p class="intro">Suncoast Home Check is founded and run by Bryan Alan Manly — your trusted set of eyes on the Gulf Coast.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="about">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">The story</p>
      <h2>Why I started Suncoast Home Check.</h2>
      <div class="gold-line"></div>
      <p style="font-size:17px;color:var(--slate);margin-bottom:14px">I'm Bryan Alan Manly, a longtime Tampa Bay real estate advisor. Over the years I've watched too many out-of-town owners come back to a home that had a quiet problem for months — a slow leak, a failed AC, humidity and mold building in a sealed-up condo, or storm damage no one caught in time.</p>
      <p style="font-size:17px;color:var(--slate);margin-bottom:14px">Home watch is the simple fix: someone reliable and local checking on your property on a schedule, and showing you exactly what they found. I already know these neighborhoods, the seasonal rhythm of the coast, and the people who own homes here. Suncoast Home Check is how I put that to work for owners who live somewhere else.</p>
      <p style="font-size:17px;color:var(--slate)">Whether you own a single-family home, a townhome, or a beachfront condo — and whether you're a snowbird, an out-of-state or overseas owner, or you're selling a Florida home you don't live in — I treat every property like my own, and I document it every visit.</p>
    </div>
    <img src="/assets/bryan.png" alt="Bryan Alan Manly, founder of Suncoast Home Check" style="width:100%;max-height:580px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top;border-radius:12px" />
  </div></div></section>

  <section class="section band"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why owners trust us</p>
      <h2>Local, responsive, and thorough.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid3">
      <div class="card"><div class="ic">📍</div><h3>Genuinely local</h3><p>Deep roots across Tampa Bay and the Gulf Coast — Bryan knows the neighborhoods, the weather, and the risks that come with a closed-up Florida home.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="ic">📸</div><h3>Documented every visit</h3><p>You get a dated photo report after each check — real proof of the condition of your home, useful for you and your insurer.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="ic">⚡</div><h3>Responsive when it counts</h3><p>If something's wrong, you hear about it right away — with photos and a recommended next step, especially during storm season.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <div class="inline-cta">
    <h2>Let's keep watch on your home.</h2>
    <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/contact/">Get a Free Quote</a>
    <a class="btn btn-navy" href="/how-it-works/">See How It Works</a>
  </div>
</Base>
